Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.80,0:00:16.80,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}The rules keep changing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:25.64,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I've been rehearsing every possible outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.80,0:00:36.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Once this thought arises, there is no more room for right or wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.24,0:00:44.72,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}I am resolved to sever this flood
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.84,0:00:51.08,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}so that my soul can break free from mediocrity,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.32,0:00:55.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}from loneliness and distinction.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.92,0:01:00.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}One more step and you'll fall into madness.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.60,0:01:05.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Don't fall down.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.04,0:01:08.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,150)}I look towards the top.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.68,0:01:11.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,500)}Chase !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.44,0:01:14.44,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Refined to perfection.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.36,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Never retreat, no matter the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.48,0:01:23.40,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}I dare to defy the heavens !
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.88,0:01:27.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Always overcome the obstacles,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.43,0:01:29.60,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)}ignite the seas with blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.76,0:01:34.04,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}bloom through trials and tribulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:38.68,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}Even the sharpest thorns
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.80,0:01:43.24,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}will be reduced into ashes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.28,0:01:47.56,Opening2,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,800)}What is there to fear ?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.72,Opening,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,690)\fad(1000,1000)}Renegade Immortal\NSubtitles by Bonobosubs\Nhttps://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:15.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,We climbed mountains
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.48,0:02:17.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to see how vast the heavens and earth are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:20.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,The heavens and the earth
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.96,0:02:22.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,really are so vast...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.56,0:02:25.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,We watched rivers
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.44,0:02:28.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to understand their surging might.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.40,0:02:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.36,0:02:35.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,these waves won't stop us !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.64,0:02:38.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,Good !
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.12,0:02:43.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We faced the seas
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.36,0:02:46.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,to grasp their boundlessness.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.64,0:02:50.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will spend my life
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.00,0:02:52.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,accompanying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.00,0:02:54.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even in death.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.04,0:02:59.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,If there is a next life,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.04,0:03:02.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,even if we are no longer father and son,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.04,0:03:04.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget you !
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.92,0:03:09.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1677,461)}8 years later
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.84,0:03:09.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,8 years of traveling mountains and rivers
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.80,0:03:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,washed his soul clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.16,0:03:13.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,The resentment is almost gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.04,0:03:15.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,only a sliver of it remains.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.00,0:03:18.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Medicine and spells are useless now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:21.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since it's deeply rooted in his soul,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.12,0:03:23.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,only time can extinguish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.24,0:03:25.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:27.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,I remember hearing when I was little
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.92,0:03:29.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,that there was immortal mist on Qilian Peak.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.60,0:03:31.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,One breath of it would keep you healthy for 10 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.96,0:03:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Back then I thought
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:35.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,that one day
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.12,0:03:37.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wanted you to bring me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.16,0:03:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's so beautiful...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.44,0:03:41.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.04,0:03:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it an Immortal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.80,0:03:46.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.52,0:03:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.88,0:03:51.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.28,0:03:53.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you an Immortal too ?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.96,0:03:57.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Not exactly an Immortal,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.08,0:04:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm just an ordinary cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.32,0:04:10.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandpa Sun,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:14.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,we've come to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.08,0:04:17.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad and I have traveled to many places.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.00,0:04:19.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,We've seen huge mountains,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,big rivers,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.48,0:04:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and the boundless sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:28.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.36,0:04:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why won't you let me learn
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.48,0:04:33.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Immortal spells Grandpa Sun left behind ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.84,0:04:36.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Because the life of a cultivator
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.32,0:04:38.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,doesn't suit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.96,0:04:40.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you mean that you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.88,0:04:42.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,you want me to live an ordinary life
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.84,0:04:44.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,instead of following your footsteps
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.93,0:04:46.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,and becoming a cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.36,0:04:48.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that it ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.32,0:04:53.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,What if
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.24,0:04:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't agree ?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.76,0:04:58.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't ever
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.68,0:05:00.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,mention this matter again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:08.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Aside from cultivation,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.08,0:05:12.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,I can give you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.52,0:05:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,everything in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.96,0:05:23.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,only by cultivating the Dao
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.12,0:05:25.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,can I stay by your side longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.68,0:05:27.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I told you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,that you are not suited for cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.60,0:05:31.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why is that ?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.96,0:05:39.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,I understand now...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.20,0:05:39.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.96,0:05:51.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,The reason Dad won't let me cultivate
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,must be because the cultivation world is too dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.00,0:05:56.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,His cultivation is low
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.40,0:05:57.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,and he can't fully protect me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.28,0:06:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad must have endured too much suffering
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,and is afraid I'll be bullied.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.44,0:06:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.72,0:06:07.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.44,0:06:18.56,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1661,573)}Vast Water City\NPlanet Ran Yun
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.36,0:06:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,From now on,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.28,0:06:32.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,we will live in this city.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.16,0:06:35.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,We will
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.48,0:06:37.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,buy a house soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.72,0:06:43.88,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(269,618)\fad(300,300)}Qing Yi\NSun Family member\NQi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.36,0:06:44.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you okay ?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.12,0:06:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Thank you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.64,0:06:46.44,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1661,618)\fad(300,000)}Yun Wufeng\NYun Family member\NQi Condensation
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.32,0:06:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.04,0:06:47.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,this place isn't bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.60,0:06:50.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,After being used to the mountains, rivers, and the sea,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.68,0:06:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,seeing this lively big city
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.16,0:06:53.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,feels like
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.64,0:06:54.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm suddenly re-entering the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.52,0:06:58.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Sister Qing Yi,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.20,0:07:00.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,that foolish boy looks amusing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.96,0:07:02.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Perhaps it's his first time in Vast Water City.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.96,0:07:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,He's putting on airs about having seen mountains and rivers
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,and spouting nonsense about re-entering the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.48,0:07:08.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is it funny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Why wouldn't it be funny ?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.36,0:07:23.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qing Yi is usually
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.20,0:07:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,cold towards everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.28,0:07:27.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,But when that man walked in,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:29.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,she actually looked at him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:32.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,With such looks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.56,0:07:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you were born a woman,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.56,0:07:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you would've been a jade beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:37.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity !
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.96,0:07:39.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You unfortunately were born a man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.52,0:07:41.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.56,0:07:43.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,maybe you can still become a prostitute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.16,0:07:45.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,With such looks,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,if you were born a man,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:48.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,you would've been graceful and handsome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.76,0:07:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,What a pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.40,0:07:52.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,You unfortunately were born an animal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.24,0:08:00.00,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(420,615)\fad(300,000)}Sun Hai\NSun Family member\NCore Formation
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.72,0:07:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,How rude !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.44,0:08:01.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,On behalf of your Elders,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:03.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will cripple your arms
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.44,0:08:04.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to teach you a lesson !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.00,0:08:05.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,No !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.48,0:08:22.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,My Golden Core...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.88,0:08:29.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Master !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.48,0:08:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don’t need you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.48,0:08:34.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,to discipline my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.80,0:08:38.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,You !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.88,0:08:39.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,You're also a cultivator !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.60,0:08:41.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,On Planet Ran Yun,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.88,0:08:42.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,offending the Sun Family
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.96,0:08:43.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,is the same as...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.20,0:08:50.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior !
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.16,0:08:53.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,We were reckless in handling this matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.28,0:08:54.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,please have mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.04,0:09:01.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,Young lady,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:03.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,is your name Qing Yi ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.96,0:09:04.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Wang Ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:07.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you also a cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.40,0:09:09.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,I haven't reached Foundation Establishment,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.80,0:09:11.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,I'm not yet a true cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.32,0:09:13.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened today
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.16,0:09:14.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,was truly our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.84,0:09:15.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.32,0:09:17.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,my master has already crushed the jade slip,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.20,0:09:19.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,so they will probably arrive soon !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.52,0:09:20.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You need to leave quickly !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(484,562)\fad(300,000)}Sun Zi\NSun Family member\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1094,484)\fad(300,000)}Sun Shang\NSun Family member\NPeak Late stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.20,0:09:28.40,Card,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1439,572)\fad(300,000)}Sun Wu\NSun Family member\NMiddle stage Nascent Soul
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.96,0:09:31.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Grandmaster Sun !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.72,0:09:33.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Uncle...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.28,0:09:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,It was him...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.24,0:09:37.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,He harmed me !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.92,0:09:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,A mortal ?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.28,0:09:50.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,This child has exceptional talent !
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.72,0:09:52.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,These two
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.28,0:09:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,are definitely not as simple as they appear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.72,0:09:57.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You acted ruthlessly by destroying
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.36,0:10:00.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Golden Core of a member of my family.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.00,0:10:03.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you really think my Sun Family will just sit idly !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.36,0:10:06.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.76,0:10:08.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.36,0:10:17.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stop here !
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.64,0:10:18.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,The matter is not settled,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.28,0:10:20.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,how dare you leave !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.36,0:10:25.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,No spell, no technique...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.00,0:10:26.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.92,0:10:28.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,pure Dao comprehension !?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.04,0:10:38.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:41.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't let it happen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.20,0:10:55.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,What happened today was truly our fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.44,0:10:56.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,That girl named Qing Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.68,0:11:00.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,seems like a good person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:09.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,This courtyard is very large
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.28,0:11:10.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,and has quite a few rooms.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.36,0:11:12.04,city,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977,456)}Wang\NMansion
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.36,0:11:13.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,When the previous owner sold the house,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.08,0:11:15.08,Second,,0,0,0,,Welcome home, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.44,0:11:16.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,they left behind some maids and servants.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.88,0:11:17.56,Second,,0,0,0,,Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.36,0:11:17.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,This
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.88,0:11:18.35,Second,,0,0,0,,Young Master...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.64,0:11:20.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,is our new home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.80,0:11:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,What's wrong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:26.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.08,0:11:27.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you acquainted with
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.52,0:11:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,the Sun Family ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.56,0:11:31.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I had some encounters with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.88,0:11:34.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,The Sun Family seems
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.72,0:11:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,to be very powerful here in Vast Water City.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.84,0:11:40.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If they really come to settle the score,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.40,0:11:42.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,what should we do ?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.80,0:11:48.08,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1601,573)}Sun Family Branch Main Residence\NVast Water City
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior did not mishear.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.36,0:11:50.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,That man indeed said
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.24,0:11:52.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,"Just this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.52,0:11:53.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't let it happen again."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.96,0:11:58.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It seems someone has no regard for the Sun Family !
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.31,0:12:01.31,Card,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,300)\pos(1665,576)}Sun Kaiping\NSun Family Branch Elder
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.24,0:12:00.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,What was
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.44,0:12:02.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,this person's surname ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:05.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.52,0:12:08.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Nephew Qing Yi spoke briefly
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.76,0:12:09.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,with those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.44,0:12:11.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Maybe she knows.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.56,0:12:14.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Do you know ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:16.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,You dare to lie to me ?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.60,0:12:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,How audacious !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.80,0:12:22.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.44,0:12:24.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,really doesn't know !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.84,0:12:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Enough !
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.60,0:12:30.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,I have already reported this to the main family.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.44,0:12:32.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a few days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.68,0:12:35.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,a Soul Transformation Elder will come to handle it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.72,0:12:38.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,As for you, an outsider by blood,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.56,0:12:40.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,you will be confined
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.60,0:12:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,for your favoritism of outsiders.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.28,0:12:44.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,We'll deal with you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.44,0:12:49.76,city,,0,0,0,,{\pos(940,574)\fad(300,300)}Wang\N\NMansion
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.48,0:12:57.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,Family Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.24,0:13:05.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Named Wang ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.52,0:13:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,When I probed with Divine Sense,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.76,0:13:09.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I found nothing unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.80,0:13:13.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sun Qiming of the Sun Family
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.52,0:13:15.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to fellow cultivator.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,The master has
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.80,0:13:23.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,instructed you
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.68,0:13:24.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.40,0:13:27.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,He won't even see us ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.28,0:13:27.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Indeed !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.40,0:13:29.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,How dare he make the Family Head wait ?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.96,0:13:30.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,How outrageous !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.72,0:13:31.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is truly outrageous !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.16,0:13:36.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Such an arrogant attitude,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.52,0:13:38.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,do you really think the Sun family is that weak !?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.92,0:13:53.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,That familiar Ascendant aura...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.44,0:13:53.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.84,0:13:55.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's him !
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.76,0:14:01.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior deserves to be punished
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.44,0:14:02.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,for disturbing Senior's cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.16,0:14:03.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.24,0:14:05.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,will leave immediately !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.56,0:14:06.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,Go !
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.16,0:14:15.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.96,0:14:19.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,you lived 19 years of an ordinary life in Fallen Moon Village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.92,0:14:22.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,For 8 years you experienced traveling through
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.04,0:14:24.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,mountains, rivers, and seas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.60,0:14:27.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,A human's life,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.36,0:14:29.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,the joys and sorrows,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.12,0:14:32.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,poverty and riches, nobility and peasantry...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.36,0:14:33.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,You should experience all of it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.60,0:14:35.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,for your life to be complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.16,0:14:37.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,After that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:41.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,I promise you 30 years of wealth and honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.72,0:14:44.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.24,0:14:46.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,are you and the Sun Family
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.08,0:14:48.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,only acquaintances ?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.20,0:14:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your father once promised
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.80,0:14:55.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,to protect their family for 100 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:14:59.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I didn't expect Father's cultivation to be so high
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.04,0:15:02.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,that even the leader of the Sun Family would cower in fear before you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.68,0:15:05.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,I originally thought
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.76,0:15:07.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,you couldn't protect me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.76,0:15:11.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,and that it was the reason you didn't want me to cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.08,0:15:13.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.36,0:15:16.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I truly cannot understand
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.84,0:15:18.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,why Father refuses to let me cultivate !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.68,0:15:19.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.88,0:15:22.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,you're not suited for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.04,0:15:24.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,30 years of wealth and honor...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.36,0:15:26.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is that your compensation
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.40,0:15:29.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,for not letting me cultivate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.16,0:15:31.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:34.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:36.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,what is true wealth and honor ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.20,0:15:40.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,What kind of wealth and honor do you want ?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.72,0:15:42.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,You once taught me
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.52,0:15:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,that a person should defy the heavens
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.64,0:15:47.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,and refuse to be crushed by the heavens and the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.96,0:15:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Climb mountains when you encounter them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.44,0:15:50.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,cross rivers when you encounter them,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:51.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,cross the seas when you encounter them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.48,0:15:53.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Never give in
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.96,0:15:55.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,when facing the heavens and the earth !
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.40,0:15:57.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Since you won't let me cultivate
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.80,0:15:59.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,then I will become
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.76,0:16:02.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,the supreme ruler among mortals !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.08,0:16:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,If that is what you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.04,0:16:05.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.44,0:16:07.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,I don't want things to be handed to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.60,0:16:09.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will conquer the world
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.24,0:16:11.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,by myself !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.44,0:16:17.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,You've grown up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.36,0:16:20.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.08,0:16:27.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.72,0:16:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,you can give me everything
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:32.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,so why won't you let me cultivate ?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.24,0:16:35.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am not suited
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.08,0:16:37.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,to cultivate the Dao...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.80,0:16:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I promised you back then
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.60,0:16:42.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,that I would stay by your side forever !
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.08,0:16:45.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.76,0:16:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,you are too lonely...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.88,0:16:53.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,Protect him
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.92,0:16:54.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,on his journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.28,0:16:57.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ping'er,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.92,0:17:00.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,it's not that I won't let you cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's that you can't cultivate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.04,0:17:07.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,One day, you will understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.32,0:17:11.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,But I hope that day
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.12,0:17:13.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,comes as late as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.24,0:17:16.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,Even
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.16,0:17:20.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,that it never comes at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.84,0:17:25.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,All members of the Sun Family, listen to me !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.40,0:17:28.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Don't step within 1000 zhang of the Wang Mansion !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.20,0:17:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Those who do
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.28,0:17:31.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,will be crippled
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.48,0:17:32.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,and be expelled from the family !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.08,0:17:38.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fa...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.80,0:17:39.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,Family Head,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.16,0:17:41.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,who is that person ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.64,0:17:43.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who is he ?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.12,0:17:46.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is someone before whom even our Ancestor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.16,0:17:48.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,would kneel to and bow with respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.12,0:17:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,He is the benefactor
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.68,0:17:52.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,our Sun Family owes its situation to !
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.28,0:17:55.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,And you dared to provoke him !?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.24,0:17:59.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Could it be that person...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.36,0:18:01.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Senior Xu Mu ?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.48,0:18:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,You nearly brought a disaster
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.76,0:18:14.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,upon our Sun Family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.32,0:18:17.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,I will tell this matter
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.96,0:18:19.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,to the Yun Family Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.88,0:18:21.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,You
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.80,0:18:23.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,should better watch out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.84,0:18:28.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is all because of you !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.40,0:18:31.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,If you hadn't looked at that boy a few times,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have provoked him !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:34.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:36.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have offended Xu Mu's son !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.44,0:18:37.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,This is all because of you !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.56,0:18:42.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,Qing Yi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:43.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,let's flee.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.96,0:18:45.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,If the Family Head finds out about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.80,0:18:47.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,they will beat me to death !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.00,0:18:49.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,Now that you've also been expelled from the Sun Family,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.56,0:18:50.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,your cultivation is sealed
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.44,0:18:51.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,and you're no different from a mortal !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.92,0:18:53.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,We are a better match now !
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.68,0:18:54.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,In this vast world,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:55.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,no one will be able to find us !
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.36,0:19:07.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior Qing Yi
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.44,0:19:08.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,pays respects to Senior.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.52,0:19:12.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Your talent
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.04,0:19:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,is pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:17.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Spend a lifetime with Ping'er
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.16,0:19:19.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,and I'll give you Nascent Soul cultivation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.92,0:19:21.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you willing ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.16,0:19:29.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,I am Wang Ping.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.76,0:19:32.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,Are you also a cultivator ?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.24,0:19:33.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,Junior
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:35.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,is willing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.32,0:19:48.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,Over 800 years of cultivation
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.32,0:19:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,and this is the first time I've gotten drunk
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.40,0:19:55.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,on mundane wine...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.00,0:19:56.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,Father,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.60,0:19:58.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.48,0:20:07.99,Sub,,0,0,0,,Is the wine too strong ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.04,0:20:10.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,Or is it
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.24,0:20:13.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,that my heart
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.40,0:20:14.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,is too heavy ?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.28,0:20:37.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,Karma...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.80,0:20:41.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,So this is
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.40,0:20:45.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,karma ?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.00,0:21:35.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}Go ahead and take a look
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.96,0:21:35.04,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}on the other side of the mountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.08,0:21:41.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,1000)}See if the wind is blowing
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:41.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}across the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.76,0:21:48.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}A lush tree always grows
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.00,0:21:48.44,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}from a tender shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.24,0:21:56.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}That tree shields you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.24,0:21:56.00,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}from half of the cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.00,0:22:02.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}The scent of the herbs and the smoke
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.96,0:22:02.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,800)}have drifted away from the stove
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.36,0:22:09.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}whose fire has warmed up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.20,0:22:09.48,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}half of your lifetime.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.48,0:22:15.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}I watch you smile
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.80,0:22:15.24,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}as you run back to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.48,0:22:22.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}That cry, however,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.72,0:22:22.80,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,600)}came out slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.80,0:22:30.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,200)}I'll take you on a journey through the mortal world,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.52,0:22:30.08,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,200)}as autumn fades and spring returns.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.08,0:22:36.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}A few snowflakes have fallen from the eaves,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.52,0:22:36.92,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}I hope this letter finds you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.96,0:22:43.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,200)}I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.28,0:22:43.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,200)}having weathered the storms of our journey so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.56,0:22:50.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}Looking back, the smell of the food
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.44,0:22:50.28,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,600)}hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.40,0:22:53.64,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,500)}Take your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.64,0:23:00.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,400)}I’ve walked through this world with you
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.00,0:23:00.84,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,400)}and listened to the joys and sorrows of the mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.84,0:23:07.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}As I count the falling leaves, as spring warms,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.12,0:23:07.76,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,1000)}another year has flown by.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.92,0:23:14.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}I’ll wait for you under the locust tree,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.36,0:23:14.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,600)}having weathered the storms of our journey so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.60,0:23:21.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,800)}Looking back, the smell of the food
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.20,0:23:21.96,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,800)}hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.24,0:23:28.56,Music,,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,600)}Take your time.
